WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.502
-Guys, do you ever see a photo
in the news

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.836
and think, "That headline
could be much better"?

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:04.870
I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.272
It's time for
"News and Improved."

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.674
Here we go.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:12.946
-♪ "News and Improved" ♪

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:16.015
-For example,
check out this first photo.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.951
The original headline was...

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.487
That headline can definitely
be improved,

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:23.189
'cause if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.791
the headline could have been...

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:31.497
Like, yes!

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:32.932
Check out this next photo.

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.401
The original headline was...

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.704
But if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:40.240
the headline could have been...

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:45.044
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:00:45.044 --> 00:00:47.346
I didn't know those existed.
Never heard of those.

00:00:47.346 --> 00:00:49.349
Up next, this headline says...

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:54.554
But the headline
could have been...

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.760
"Hey, hey!

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.529
Uh, uh, uh...

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:05.498
Guy?"

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:06.833
Next headline was...

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.037
Headline could have been...

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:17.243
[ Applause ]

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:18.978
Should have waited
for after the game.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.447
The next headline was...

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.150
Headline could have been...

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:32.825
She wrote it in glow pen.

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:34.627
Up next, this headline says...

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:37.964
The headline could have been...

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:44.037
Oh, I'm excited for that.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:46.840
This next headline was...

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.176
Headline could have been...

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.182
Good for you.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.118
And finally,
this headline was...

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.288
Headline could have been...

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.394
That's all the time we have
for "News and Improved."

